  (Host_Sends_Certified_Q_K_cred( TPM, Host, pke, R, S, T, W, sigma2
   ) @ #t02)
 ∧
  (#t01 < #t02) ∧
  (¬(sigma1 = sigma2)) ∧
  (∀ RevealEvent ENTITY #k1.
    (KeyReveal( RevealEvent, ENTITY ) @ #k1) ⇒ ⊥) ∧
  (∀ event #i #j.
    (OnlyOnce( event ) @ #i) ∧ (OnlyOnce( event ) @ #j) ⇒ #i = #j)"
*/
by sorry

